## 1. Scope

This reference covers cold shrink terminations and straight joints for 8.7/15 kV medium voltage XLPE cable. It concentrates on the two things that decide whether the accessory survives: where the stress cone sits, and how the cable screen cut-back is executed.

## 2. Construction

- Pre-expanded silicone or EPDM insulating sleeve with an integrated geometric stress cone.
- Conductive deflector at the cable screen end, moulded into the sleeve rather than added as a separate part on site.
- Outdoor versions carry moulded rain sheds over the same insulating body.
- Sealing at the sheath and at the lug end by mastic and an elastic sealing lip.

