## 4. Selection and sizing

- Cable insulation diameter and screen cut-back length, which are the two dimensions the drawing actually controls.
- Indoor or outdoor, because creepage and shed profile differ.
- Single-core or three-core, since three-core accessories are applied per core.
- Metallic screen construction and whether the screen needs a separate earthing connection.
- Terminal type and stud size where the termination lands on switchgear or a transformer.

